      {
        "id": "executive_summary",
        "type": "markdown",
        "layout": "full",
        "body": "## 技術摘要\n\n**整體判定：部分完成。** NHTSA 官方 bulk/API、PartSouq 歷史 archive、MySQL、站方 CRUD／對帳、月排程、raw/provenance、package 與 E2E 已完成。PartSouq 標準 Playwright live canary 仍收到 Cloudflare 403 challenge，所以 current/live 全量未完成；165,686 是歷史 fitment，不是今日全站。"
      },
      {
        "id": "headline_metrics_block",
        "type": "metric-strip",
        "layout": "full",
        "cardIds": [
          "live_records_card",
          "historical_fitments_card",
