      {
        "id": "key_findings",
        "type": "markdown",
        "layout": "full",
        "body": "## 關鍵結論\n\n1. NHTSA current publication：457 artifacts、12 datasets、9,876,638 source rows、0 rejected。\n2. PartSouq 歷史資料：52,102 part numbers、165,686 fitments；全部 `is_verified=0`。\n3. PartSouq live current：標準 Playwright 403 challenge，verified current fitments 為 0。\n4. 23,709 raw bodies 與 457 NHTSA artifacts 已逐檔／逐 body 驗 SHA、size 與 rows，0 mismatch。\n5. 最終完整 suite：148 passed、82% coverage、0 warning。\n6. GitHub active CLI、SSH identity 與 remote owner 都是個人帳號 `a861252012`；commit `a307796` 已推送到 private draft PR #1。"
      },
